    "title": "Two suspected drug packages found - NewsBreak",
    "text": "14 hours ago\nTwo suspected drug packages were found in separate incidents on the same day.\nA package containing suspected cocaine weighing approximately one kilogram was found offshore of the Lower Keys at approximately 1 p.m. on Aug. 4, 2026, and brought ashore near Mile Marker 34.\nA package containing suspected marijuana of an unspecified weight was found approximately 14 miles off of Ramrod Key at approximately 3 p.m. on Aug. 4, 2026, and was brought ashore.\nBoth packages were found by mariners and turned over to the U.S. Border Patrol.",
    "summary": "Two suspected drug packages were found in separate incidents on the same day. A package containing suspected cocaine weighing approximately one kilogram was found offshore of the Lower Keys at approximately 1 p.m. on Aug. 4, 2026, and brought ashore near Mile Marker 34. A package containing suspected marijuana of an unspecified weight was found approximately 14 miles off of Ramrod Key at approximately 3 p.m. on Aug. 4, 2026, and was brought ashore. Both packages were found by mariners and turned over to the U.S. Border Patrol.",
